{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>From the fire.</b> For it is entirely given to Heaven, and the priests have no portion in it except after the burning of the fires, for they acquire their portion from the table on high — therefore."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "Reading אֵשִׁים as 'fires,' i.e., the portions consumed on the altar; the phrase מִשֻּׁלְחַן גָּבוֹהַּ קָא זָכוּ is Aramaic and rendered literally into English."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:20.047079514Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}